---
import aboutImage from "../assets/images/about-muscle-up.png";
---

<section id="about" class="bg-[#0f0f0f] py-20 text-white lg:py-28">
  <div
    class="mx-auto grid w-full max-w-[1500px] gap-12 px-6 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_.9fr] lg:items-center lg:px-10"
  >
    <div class="relative min-h-[460px] overflow-hidden lg:min-h-[620px]">
      <img
        src={aboutImage.src}
        alt="Muscle Up training community"
        class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover grayscale"
      />

      <div
        class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/55 via-transparent to-transparent"
      >
      </div>

      <div class="absolute bottom-6 left-6 max-w-[220px]">
        <p class="font-display text-3xl uppercase leading-[.95]">
          Progress
          <br />
          builds
          <br />
          character.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="lg:pl-12">
      <div class="mb-6 flex items-center gap-4">
        <span class="h-[2px] w-7 bg-[#F04A2A]"></span>

        <p
          class="text-[.65rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-[#F04A2A]"
        >
          About Muscle Up
        </p>
      </div>

      <h2
        class="font-display text-[clamp(3.5rem,6vw,6.5rem)] uppercase leading-[.82] tracking-[-.045em]"
      >
        A stronger
        <br />
        community
        <br />
        <span class="text-[#F04A2A]">together.</span>
      </h2>

      <div
        class="mt-8 max-w-[520px] space-y-5 text-sm leading-[1.8] text-white/65 lg:text-base"
      >
        <p>
          Muscle Up was built for people who want more than just access to
          equipment. We believe progress comes from consistency, good coaching,
          and a community that pushes each other forward.
        </p>

        <p>
          Whether you're building strength, improving conditioning, or simply
          becoming more capable every day, our training environment is designed
          to help you keep moving forward.
        </p>
      </div>

      <a
        href="#programs"
        class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-8 border-b border-white/35 pb-2 text-[.7rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.15em] no-underline transition-opacity hover:opacity-60"
      >
        Learn More
        <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
